      "result": "CONFIRMED_STATICALLY_FOR_CANDIDATE_7E99600D",
      "details": "irq_handle takes the global IRQ/stop mutex around irq_handle_stock_exact; that stock body calls richtap_update_fifo_data. richtap_rtp_work takes the same mutex around kernel FIFO cursor/count mutation, drops it during the producer wait, and reacquires it for playback and callbacks. This serializes the two in-kernel consumers. It is a hardening deviation from stock.",
